 '[
   {"text": "3", "feedback": "Substitute 3 back in: the left side gives 12 and the right gives 18. Not equal, so try again."},
   {"text": "9", "feedback": "Check the step where you collect the x terms. 5x − 2x gives 3x, not x."},
