 '[{"text": "18 quarters", "feedback": "18 is actually the number of dimes — recheck which variable the system solves for."}, {"text": "45 quarters", "feedback": "This uses the total coin count as if every coin were a quarter — but the jar has a mix of dimes and quarters."}, {"text": "34 quarters", "feedback": "Check this value: 34 quarters would already be worth $8.50 with only 11 dimes left, totalling $9.60, not $8.55."}, {"text": "27 quarters", "feedback": "Correct. With d + q = 45 and 0.10d + 0.25q = 8.55, substituting d = 45 − q gives 0.15q = 4.05, so q = 27."}]'::jsonb,
