 '[{"text": "On the circle, since 12² + 5² = 169 = 169", "feedback": "Correct. Substituting the point into x²+y² gives exactly 169, matching r², so it lies exactly on the circle."}, {"text": "Inside the circle", "feedback": "Substituting the point gives 12²+5²=169, which equals r² exactly — that means on the circle, not inside it."}, {"text": "Outside the circle", "feedback": "Substituting the point gives 12²+5²=169, which equals r² exactly — that means on the circle, not outside it."}, {"text": "Cannot be determined without graphing", "feedback": "Substituting the point''s coordinates into x²+y² and comparing to r² is always enough to decide this."}]'::jsonb,
