('MPM2D', 'quadratic-relations', 'completing-the-square', 5, 'Easy',
 'What value completes the square for x² + 10x + ___?', 0,
 '[{"text": "25", "feedback": "Correct. Halve the coefficient of x (10 ÷ 2 = 5), then square that result: 5² = 25."}, {"text": "10", "feedback": "This is the original coefficient of x, before it''s halved and squared."}, {"text": "5", "feedback": "This is only halfway there — 10 ÷ 2 = 5 still needs to be squared."}, {"text": "100", "feedback": "This squares 10 directly instead of halving it first. Halve 10, then square the result."}]'::jsonb,
