 '[{"text": "2.4", "feedback": "This divides instead of multiplying — the larger triangle''s side should be bigger than 6, not smaller."}, {"text": "12", "feedback": "This doubles 6, using only the ''2'' from the ratio — the full ratio 2:5 needs to be applied as a scale factor."}, {"text": "15", "feedback": "Correct. The scale factor from smaller to larger is 5÷2 = 2.5, so 6 × 2.5 = 15."}, {"text": "13", "feedback": "This adds 6+5+2 rather than applying the ratio as a scale factor — multiply 6 by 5÷2 instead."}]'::jsonb,
